-- Sovietski: the Firebird and Whirlwind Heavy Machines, WB36 cyborg bodies with no WB17 counterpart, held as new rows (printed 134-138).
-- 2 vehicle rows, with 20 locations and 9 weapon entries.
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration - it adds
-- rows, not schema.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/~395-sovietski-cyborgs-b.sql
--
-- Written by scripts/vessel-sql.mjs from 1 worker file(s). Every value
